      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "- Continuing with the previous example, updating John Doe’s address only in one \nplace leads to an inconsistency where the database has both \"123 Main St\" and\n\"Owashika Road\" for the same customer.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Continuing with the previous example, updating John Doe’s address only in one place leads to an inconsistency where the database has both \"123 Main St\" and \"Owashika Road\" for the same customer.",
