      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1725484203562,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Normalization is carried out through a series of steps known as normal forms. Each normal \nform addresses specific types of redundancy and anomalies.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Normalization is carried out through a series of steps known as normal forms. Each normal form addresses specific types of redundancy and anomalies.",
